                <pb facs="0666" n="556" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg556"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.51/1981: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Eberhardt</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-08-25T12:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 25,
                                1928—noon</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>169. Your 303, August 7, 10 a.m., and Department’s 163, August 14, 7 p.m. The
                    bankers have now definitely decided that they do not wish to submit a copy of
                    the draft Financial Plan to President Diaz at the present time.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
